":"다쳐서","audio":"/audio/2468584acbbe667f00d3.mp3"}},{"text":"동물","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔어.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔어","audio":"/audio/b0db3334f4b23c7c80c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"906127f7d7957123","term":"꼬리","zh":"尾巴","audio":"/audio/906127f7d7957123454e.mp3","entryId":"32577","definition":"动物身体的末端附着或突出的部分。","pronunciation":["꼬리"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","ent